OL,6,
OL,7,F"Significant flooding" hits Birmingham
OL,8,Fand Staffordshire
OL,10,FOther parts of the West Midlands also
OL,11,Fdeal with fallout from the weather
OL,13,FOne business owner says she has 'lost
